01:19.120 --> 01:19.160
Tone River
A Class A River
-Ibaraki Prefecture-

01:28.290 --> 01:28.340
Once Upon a

01:28.290 --> 01:28.340
Time in Chiba

01:33.220 --> 01:36.890
IBARAKI PREFECTURE MITSUKUNI

01:33.220 --> 01:36.890
TECHNICAL HIGH SCHOOL

01:33.440 --> 01:37.110
'Sup!

01:41.290 --> 01:42.480
N-Nakano!

01:42.480 --> 01:44.990
Oh, what’s the word, Sorikomi.

01:44.990 --> 01:48.930
Those off-brands from Ibari High are starting to flex at the station.

01:48.930 --> 01:51.450
You wanna roll down there with us?

01:51.450 --> 01:54.000
Sure thing. I’ll be there.

01:54.000 --> 01:54.910
For real?!

01:54.910 --> 01:55.960
We owe you one!

01:56.420 --> 01:57.660
Later.

01:57.660 --> 02:00.840
They sure like to keep you busy, Nakano.

02:01.660 --> 02:03.500
Just ignore them.

02:03.500 --> 02:06.180
They also asked you to stomp on the Nando High crew, remember?

02:06.180 --> 02:11.140
What gives, Mura? Is this a lecture I’m hearing?

02:11.140 --> 02:12.510
N-No, it isn’t!

02:12.510 --> 02:15.980
It’s just the way you always turn into this evil dude that worries me.

02:17.000 --> 02:18.530
I’m cool with that.

02:18.530 --> 02:22.940
I gotta throw down once in a while, else I’ll die of boredom.

02:22.940 --> 02:24.480
Ah yeah, didja hear?

02:24.480 --> 02:28.120
Honma, the new guy in Class 2, got a serious attitude problem.

02:28.120 --> 02:30.080
Attitude problem?

02:30.080 --> 02:33.020
They say his pop's the don of the Akuratsu Family.

02:33.020 --> 02:35.580
His father’s a don? Get out.

02:36.240 --> 02:40.410
He thinks he can talk shit 'cause he got access to gats and stuff.

02:48.470 --> 02:49.900
C’mon, let’s bounce.

02:49.900 --> 02:51.650
Sorikomi, let’s hit the arcade.

02:51.650 --> 02:52.440
All right.

02:56.390 --> 02:58.300
N-Nakano!

02:58.300 --> 03:01.490
Weren’t we gonna take care of those Ibari punks at the station?

03:01.490 --> 03:02.980
You know, <i>today?</i>

03:02.980 --> 03:04.090
Oh, that?

03:04.090 --> 03:06.960
That’s already done. It’s <i>been taken care of.</i>

03:06.960 --> 03:08.530
Th-Thanks, though!

03:08.530 --> 03:10.250
What the shit?

03:10.250 --> 03:12.240
Oh, Nakano!

03:12.240 --> 03:15.240
You don’t need to worry about Nando High no more.

03:15.240 --> 03:17.210
Someone else had our backs.

03:17.210 --> 03:18.400
Huh?

03:18.400 --> 03:19.580
The fuck’s wrong with you?

03:19.580 --> 03:21.920
Is this how you treat a guy who helps with your shit?!

03:21.920 --> 03:24.090
Uh, we don’t mean no disrespect.

03:24.090 --> 03:26.220
Then what do you fucking mean?!

03:26.220 --> 03:28.720
No, look, it’s Honma.

03:28.720 --> 03:32.590
He says he can handle things a lot better than Nakano.

03:32.590 --> 03:35.040
He also says we can ask him for anything.

03:35.040 --> 03:35.820
Honma?

03:35.820 --> 03:37.180
That’d be me.

03:38.420 --> 03:39.680
Honma!

03:39.680 --> 03:42.160
Is this finger fucker Nakano?

03:42.160 --> 03:43.360
Yes, he is!

03:54.590 --> 03:56.040
Talk about a runt.

03:56.040 --> 04:00.750
Aren’t you guys even ashamed at how fast you got switched?!

04:00.750 --> 04:04.890
Says you. This guy’s dad is the fucking don of the Akuratsu Family!

04:04.890 --> 04:08.090
Anyone with a brain between their ears would roll with Honma.

04:08.090 --> 04:10.110
That’s how it is.

04:15.010 --> 04:16.970
What are <i>you looking at?</i>

04:19.830 --> 04:22.390
What, you wanna take me on?

04:22.390 --> 04:24.900
The whole Akuratsu Family will be on your ass.

04:37.640 --> 04:40.030
Look! <i>The Nakano just turned and ran!</i>

04:40.030 --> 04:41.420
Like a bitch!

04:45.850 --> 04:47.240
Nakano.

04:52.420 --> 04:53.570
Like a bitch!

04:53.570 --> 04:55.290
<i>The Nakano turned and ran!</i>

04:55.290 --> 04:58.850
Aren’t you guys even ashamed at how fast you got switched?!

04:58.850 --> 05:02.940
Says you. This guy’s dad is the fucking don of the Akuratsu Family!

05:02.940 --> 05:06.310
Anyone with a brain between their ears would roll with Honma.

05:06.850 --> 05:09.280
Spineless fucks.

05:19.030 --> 05:19.910
So...

05:19.910 --> 05:20.640
Yeah?

05:21.390 --> 05:22.090
Time to split?

05:22.090 --> 05:22.890
Yeah.

05:22.890 --> 05:24.580
Wait, dammit!

05:25.520 --> 05:28.460
Ain't you gonna fight me, you Chiba monkeyshits!

05:28.460 --> 05:31.000
Whoa, gotta admire that heart.

05:31.000 --> 05:33.940
All that sticky natto made you stick it out this long.

05:33.940 --> 05:38.220
But we’re calling it a night, or else our teachers’ll have a fit.

05:38.220 --> 05:40.050
Hope we meet up again, though.

05:40.050 --> 05:41.430
Later.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.970
Come back here!

05:42.970 --> 05:45.140
Itou, is that leg bothering you?

05:45.140 --> 05:48.030
It's not! Aren’t <i>you still feeling woozy?</i>

05:48.030 --> 05:50.710
What? I can take on 50 right now!

05:50.710 --> 05:53.240
Ooh, you’re one <i>crazy dude!</i>

05:55.700 --> 05:59.450
It was Nanyou High School, wasn’t it?

06:01.440 --> 06:03.900
IBARAKI PREFECTURE MITSUKUNI

06:01.440 --> 06:03.900
TECHNICAL HIGH SCHOOL

06:04.120 --> 06:05.440
Hey!

06:04.600 --> 06:05.440
'Sup!

06:07.080 --> 06:11.760
I love a student body that can switch sides in a snap.

06:11.760 --> 06:15.800
Now, who hasn’t greeted me yet?

06:20.800 --> 06:22.470
Yo, you heard?

06:22.470 --> 06:24.580
Nakano bitched out and ran.

06:24.580 --> 06:26.800
Even Nakano can’t bump with that dude.

06:26.800 --> 06:29.420
Then that means Honma’s the new boss around here?

06:35.600 --> 06:38.450
Good. Pretending I’m not here, eh?

06:38.450 --> 06:41.910
I fucking love you guys.

06:45.080 --> 06:47.680
God, stubborn-ass son of a bitch!

06:47.680 --> 06:52.300
Honma’s a generous guy.
He’s still willing to let you join up!

06:52.300 --> 06:53.610
Y-You pricks...

06:53.610 --> 06:57.000
You owe Nakano fucking blowjobs for the shit he’s done for you!

06:57.000 --> 06:58.960
Ain’t your asses even ashamed?

06:58.960 --> 07:05.580
You just bow your head to Honma and beg him to let you be his loyal soldier.

07:07.950 --> 07:11.230
It’s better if you stick with the strong, Mura.

07:11.230 --> 07:13.070
And you call yourself a man?

07:13.070 --> 07:15.030
You’re starting to piss me off.

07:15.030 --> 07:16.630
Wh-What’re you doing?

07:16.630 --> 07:17.830
Don’t!

07:17.830 --> 07:20.490
I don’t see you as much of a body piercing guy.

07:18.310 --> 07:19.350
Stop!

07:19.350 --> 07:20.490
Lemme go!

07:21.240 --> 07:23.330
But how’s about 2 or 3 for starters?

07:23.330 --> 07:24.920
Just tell me where you want 'em.

07:24.920 --> 07:27.310
Don’t do it! Stop now!

07:27.310 --> 07:29.910
You mean, "Stop, <i>please.</i>"

07:29.910 --> 07:32.030
Stop what you’re doing, bitch.

07:38.250 --> 07:44.880
You’re the first dude who has <i>ever given me that lip.</i>

07:45.680 --> 07:47.980
You took the words right out of my...

07:48.560 --> 07:50.150
fucking mouth!

08:00.970 --> 08:04.200
What’s this? You punks got no fight left in ya's?

08:04.200 --> 08:06.550
You ain’t gonna get me or nothing?

08:06.550 --> 08:08.400
You’re in deep shit now.

08:11.290 --> 08:15.590
I hear his pop’s real protective of his kid. What’ll you do?

08:15.590 --> 08:17.480
This place ain’t doing it for me no more.

08:17.480 --> 08:19.420
I’m winging for other parts.

08:19.420 --> 08:21.010
Keep it real, Mura.

08:21.010 --> 08:22.340
Other parts?

08:22.340 --> 08:25.500
Where the hell are you headed, Nakano?

08:28.090 --> 08:31.350
To a place where a true motherfucker lives,

08:31.350 --> 08:34.060
who throws three punches for every one.

08:34.060 --> 08:35.260
Huh?

08:47.900 --> 08:47.940
PHON

08:47.900 --> 08:47.940
TODAY'S NOISE LEVEL

09:06.090 --> 09:07.120
Excuse me.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.060
Dumbass.

09:09.430 --> 09:11.640
You calling <i>me a dumbass?</i>

09:11.640 --> 09:14.440
Yeah, I was talking to <i>you,</i> dumbass.

09:14.440 --> 09:16.090
I see...

09:17.010 --> 09:18.650
So I’m a dumbass now?

09:22.040 --> 09:25.280
Your killer is Imai Katsutoshi of Beni High!

09:25.280 --> 09:26.600
Remember that!

09:27.940 --> 09:29.820
Now die!

09:29.770 --> 09:29.860
BANG!

09:34.560 --> 09:36.420
Who the fuck is this dude?

09:43.100 --> 09:44.730
What the hell are you looking at?

09:44.730 --> 09:46.430
This ain’t a sideshow!

09:46.430 --> 09:48.630
I'm gonna kill you, dumbass!

09:54.480 --> 09:57.050
You calling me a dumbass, schoolboy?

09:57.050 --> 10:01.110
Who says that to the guy whose bike he just trashed, huh?

10:01.110 --> 10:03.700
A-A yakuza!

10:03.700 --> 10:05.130
Ya got something to say, say it!

10:05.130 --> 10:07.860
O-Oh, was this your bicycle by any chance?

10:07.860 --> 10:11.700
Yeah! That cost me a million and you’re gonna pay back every yen!

10:11.700 --> 10:12.640
A million?!

10:12.640 --> 10:13.610
That’s crazy!

10:13.610 --> 10:15.670
I mean, that can’t be true.

10:15.670 --> 10:17.310
You calling me a liar?

10:17.310 --> 10:19.290
Are you hurting for a fight, huh?

10:19.290 --> 10:20.130
No!

10:20.550 --> 10:24.860
They’re still at it? Chiba’s full of crazy characters.

10:26.330 --> 10:28.910
So you gonna cough up that million?

10:28.910 --> 10:32.330
Or does I have to drag your ass to our establishment?

10:32.330 --> 10:33.680
No, that’s not...

10:33.680 --> 10:35.390
That’s him!

10:35.390 --> 10:38.080
Dammit! Man up and tell me what it’s gonna be!

10:38.080 --> 10:40.450
Am I still a dumbass, eh, schoolboy?

10:40.450 --> 10:41.360
Uh, no you're not!

10:41.360 --> 10:43.820
Wait! D-Don’t do it!

10:43.820 --> 10:45.360
You think this is a game, you—

10:48.200 --> 10:49.240
Mitsuhashi!

10:49.620 --> 10:51.270
Take this, you fucking

10:51.270 --> 10:52.410
piece of shit!

10:52.410 --> 10:53.240
How's that?

10:54.700 --> 10:57.720
If you’re gonna fight, at least take on Akehisa, Imai!

10:57.720 --> 10:58.920
M-Mitsuhashi!

10:58.920 --> 10:59.680
What?

10:59.680 --> 11:02.200
Y-You don’t want to mess with this gentleman.

11:07.880 --> 11:09.430
I-Imai, sir?

11:09.430 --> 11:10.110
Yes?

11:10.110 --> 11:13.140
Is this gentleman perhaps a yakuza?

11:13.140 --> 11:14.850
That appears to be the case.

11:22.070 --> 11:23.040
Sudou!

11:23.040 --> 11:23.980
What happened here?!

11:25.440 --> 11:27.570
Imai of Beni High did it!

11:27.900 --> 11:29.190
You bastard! He’s wrong!

11:29.190 --> 11:31.240
Nanyou’s Mitsuhashi did it!

11:32.110 --> 11:33.540
Come back here!

11:33.540 --> 11:35.840
Yes! I found him, at last!

11:49.460 --> 11:52.300
I shouldn’t have messed with Imai out of boredom.

11:56.350 --> 11:56.770
They caught up!

12:03.900 --> 12:04.800
Ew, gross!

12:04.800 --> 12:07.530
You're the one who wants to fight dirty!

12:07.530 --> 12:08.360
You little!

12:08.940 --> 12:11.820
You always <i>were a rat prick!</i>

12:11.820 --> 12:15.240
Yeah, that’s 'cause I’m the biggest rat prick anywhere!

12:18.430 --> 12:20.000
Listen, you petty thug.

12:20.000 --> 12:25.920
When you get back, tell your boss not to go after guys who ain’t in the life.

12:27.500 --> 12:33.430
You’re still as strong as I remembered. God, I love how you work it!

12:33.430 --> 12:35.510
What’s this guy going on about?

12:36.430 --> 12:38.900
But this time your ass is mine.

12:41.500 --> 12:42.940
I-I know you!

12:43.970 --> 12:46.900
So you finally remember me? Tight!

12:46.900 --> 12:50.610
That face, that voice, that glare... it’s all coming to me!

12:50.610 --> 12:55.330
I've never stopped thinking about you... not for a second!

12:55.330 --> 12:57.660
Yes, you’re...

12:57.660 --> 12:58.540
a sex pervert!

12:58.540 --> 12:59.500
What?

12:59.500 --> 13:01.460
Me no like creeper pervs!

13:01.670 --> 13:03.630
Dammit, you fucking with me?!

13:12.250 --> 13:14.140
Pervs are icky!

13:14.140 --> 13:17.810
I’m Imai! Imai Katsutoshi!

13:26.720 --> 13:29.680
Mura... this is it.

13:29.680 --> 13:31.930
This is where I belong.

13:37.810 --> 13:40.280
The Underworld Family

13:40.280 --> 13:40.320
HUMANITY    HONOR    LOVE

13:40.500 --> 13:45.270
So you were putting a little scare into a kid, but <i>you got pranked instead?</i>

13:49.790 --> 13:51.420
You finds that funny, Masuda?

13:51.420 --> 13:54.130
Come on, you’re Satan Sudou, remember?

13:54.130 --> 13:57.380
But you got stink fingered by a high schooler!

13:57.380 --> 13:58.830
That must’ve hurt like hell!

13:58.830 --> 14:01.900
Especially with your hemorrhoids!

14:02.890 --> 14:04.220
Hemorrhoids, eh?

14:05.600 --> 14:08.770
Yeah... the size of golf balls!

14:19.930 --> 14:21.660
My sides!

14:25.340 --> 14:26.350
Masuda!

14:26.350 --> 14:28.920
You know every two-bit
knucklehead around town!

14:28.920 --> 14:31.630
Have them find Imai and that blond guy!

14:31.450 --> 14:31.490
BENIBANE SENIOR HIGH SCHOOL

14:34.260 --> 14:36.600
"Neither rain nor driving wind will stop me."

14:36.600 --> 14:39.480
"I will eat five bowls of rice every day."

14:36.750 --> 14:36.790
The Shell Fire
and other stories

14:36.750 --> 14:36.790
By Miyazawa Kenji

14:39.480 --> 14:42.430
"If people are fighting in the west, I will go help."

14:40.010 --> 14:41.330
Hey!

14:41.330 --> 14:43.390
Yo, what’s with you guys?

14:42.430 --> 14:46.230
"If the dead are in the east, I will express no interest."

14:46.230 --> 14:49.190
"If people laugh in the north,
I will go and take them down."

14:49.190 --> 14:51.270
What do you think you’re doing, Imai?

14:51.270 --> 14:51.820
What?!

14:55.210 --> 14:58.660
How’d you know it was me? I thought this was the perfect disguise.

14:58.660 --> 15:01.760
That new look won’t get you many dates.

15:01.760 --> 15:04.040
In any case, you still run this school.

15:04.040 --> 15:06.560
You need to shape up in front of others.

15:06.560 --> 15:09.350
Yeah, uh, listen up, guys.

15:09.350 --> 15:14.280
I've been acting like a hoodlum all my life, but I think I've taken things too far.

15:15.090 --> 15:19.080
People need to take breaks from their delinquent lifestyles.

15:19.080 --> 15:21.890
It’s also necessary to add variation to your life.

15:21.890 --> 15:24.320
Did you get that from an anime?

15:24.320 --> 15:25.100
I know!

15:25.100 --> 15:27.850
Koyama, you be the new boss.

15:27.850 --> 15:28.970
Yes,

15:28.970 --> 15:30.560
I give you full authority.

15:30.560 --> 15:33.720
From this day forward, you’re to be known as Imai of Beni High.

15:33.720 --> 15:34.580
But...

15:34.580 --> 15:36.730
I will not partake in any more scuffles,

15:36.730 --> 15:39.800
so do not involve me with any of your undertakings!

15:39.800 --> 15:41.950
What in the heck happened, Imai?

15:41.950 --> 15:44.790
No, <i>you’re Imai! <i>I’m Koyama!</i></i>

15:44.790 --> 15:46.430
Are we clear, <i>Imai?</i>

15:46.430 --> 15:47.730
Of course.

15:47.730 --> 15:50.330
From this day forward I’ll be a bookworm.

15:50.330 --> 15:53.750
I’ll succumb to neither rain nor wind nor temptation to fight.

15:53.750 --> 15:57.320
Sure thing Imai, I mean Koyama.

15:57.320 --> 15:59.650
I can’t defy a direct request from my superior.

15:59.650 --> 16:01.220
Take as long a break as you need.

16:01.220 --> 16:04.560
I’ll be counting on you, Koyama, I mean Imai.

16:04.560 --> 16:05.850
You got it!

16:06.230 --> 16:09.690
If the yakuza is serious, Koyama will most likely get hurt.

16:09.690 --> 16:12.960
<i>I did<i> stoop pretty low... but this will do.</i></i>

16:12.960 --> 16:16.360
I vowed to become more of a rat bastard than Mitsuhashi anyway.

16:19.230 --> 16:21.820
"Neither rain nor driving wind will stop me."

16:21.600 --> 16:21.640
NANYOU
SENIOR
HIGH
SCHOOL

16:26.630 --> 16:28.660
You got creeped on by a weirdo?

16:28.660 --> 16:31.790
Yeah, I know, you should have seen him!

16:31.790 --> 16:33.800
You mean there's someone weirder than <i>you?</i>

16:33.800 --> 16:34.540
Itou!

16:34.540 --> 16:39.050
Actually, I can’t imagine anybody weirder than you, Three.

16:39.050 --> 16:40.380
Riko!

16:40.380 --> 16:43.970
First you messed with the yakuza and now perverts are after you?

16:43.970 --> 16:46.510
I see you’ve been keeping busy.

16:47.320 --> 16:50.480
God, I should stay the fuck away from Imai.

16:50.480 --> 16:52.230
He’s like a plague!

16:52.230 --> 16:56.340
Do what you want, just as long as you keep me out of it.

16:56.340 --> 16:57.230
Well,

16:57.230 --> 16:58.700
I’ll see you guys later.

16:59.240 --> 17:00.030
Bye now!

17:00.030 --> 17:02.050
Oh, you got a date with Kyou!

17:03.220 --> 17:04.910
What’s his deal?

17:04.910 --> 17:09.140
I was gonna tell him to watch his back. God!

17:13.870 --> 17:15.860
You find Imai or the blond kid?

17:15.860 --> 17:17.050
Nah.

17:17.050 --> 17:18.670
I couldn’t find them either!

17:18.670 --> 17:21.960
You’ll find a lot of young roughnecks around here.

17:21.960 --> 17:23.900
What if he turned rabbit?

17:23.900 --> 17:25.210
Search every corner!

17:25.210 --> 17:26.350
On it!

17:26.350 --> 17:28.870
You're goddamn right I did, Mura.

17:28.870 --> 17:32.600
I even mixed it up with that bottle blond.

17:36.270 --> 17:38.730
Mura, I’ll call you later. Bye.

17:47.050 --> 17:48.290
Kyou!

17:51.400 --> 17:52.220
Did I keep you?

17:52.220 --> 17:54.460
No, I just got here.

17:54.460 --> 17:55.460
Where should we head?

17:55.460 --> 17:56.670
Yo.

17:58.260 --> 18:00.900
You promised we’d take some together.

18:00.900 --> 18:03.880
Those photo stickers. At that thing at the arcade!

18:03.880 --> 18:04.760
Yo...?

18:04.760 --> 18:09.010
Yumi’s been showing off the ones she took with her boyfriend.

18:09.010 --> 18:10.220
Oh, on her address book?

18:10.220 --> 18:10.930
Hey.

18:10.930 --> 18:13.160
Should we be framed by hearts?

18:13.160 --> 18:16.150
Or maybe do a lovers’ umbrella?

18:16.150 --> 18:16.560
Hey!

18:16.560 --> 18:17.730
What the hell?!

18:19.590 --> 18:23.690
Sorry for butting in on your fun...

18:22.430 --> 18:23.690
Then hit the road!

18:25.630 --> 18:26.850
You’re...

18:26.850 --> 18:27.660
Who?

18:27.660 --> 18:31.500
I’m so glad we got to reunite this quick.

18:32.080 --> 18:33.810
We last met in Kyoto, right?

18:33.810 --> 18:34.870
Who is he?

18:34.870 --> 18:37.050
That Ibaraki kid... Nakano?!

18:37.050 --> 18:39.700
So glad you remember me.

18:39.700 --> 18:42.710
You’re a lot less stupid than that blond boy.

18:42.710 --> 18:44.260
Yeah, it’s been a while.

18:44.260 --> 18:47.380
So what’re you doing here in Chiba? Sightseeing?

18:47.380 --> 18:48.220
Fuck you.

18:48.220 --> 18:50.430
I came to pay you back for last time.

18:50.430 --> 18:53.290
You and your stupid tricks messed me up.

18:53.290 --> 18:56.480
They may have won you that battle...

18:57.270 --> 18:58.810
but not the war!

18:58.810 --> 19:01.920
Is this the weirdo Mitsuhashi was talking about?

19:01.920 --> 19:03.100
Itou.

19:04.200 --> 19:07.980
I know you came all the way from Ibaraki to settle scores.

19:07.980 --> 19:11.450
But I’m with my lady friend here, so can we do this later?

19:11.450 --> 19:12.330
Let’s go, Kyouko.

19:12.330 --> 19:13.540
Fuck your woman.

19:13.540 --> 19:16.250
Maybe I should start with her first.

19:16.250 --> 19:18.520
I’ll make her look like a pig!

19:18.520 --> 19:19.750
Come on, asshat!

19:19.750 --> 19:20.210
Don’t!

19:28.970 --> 19:32.350
You son of a bitch. You didn't even try to avoid my punch.

19:32.350 --> 19:34.060
Stop it, you two!

19:34.510 --> 19:37.560
That didn’t even tickle!

19:38.020 --> 19:40.550
Quit acting tough for your woman.

19:40.550 --> 19:44.980
Maybe I’ll rearrange <i>your face first to look like a pig, huh?!</i>

19:44.980 --> 19:46.900
Say that again, you piece of—

19:47.530 --> 19:49.260
Who are you...

19:49.260 --> 19:51.010
calling a pig?

19:51.010 --> 19:51.910
God!

19:52.030 --> 19:55.120
Don’t screw with me just because
I’m a girl, you droopy-eyed midget!

19:55.120 --> 19:56.620
Droopy-eyed midget?

19:56.620 --> 19:58.710
I thought I told you no fighting!

19:58.710 --> 19:59.370
Uh, right!

19:59.370 --> 20:02.110
We’re still on our date, so behave yourself!

20:02.110 --> 20:05.380
Yow! Hey, that hurts, Kyouko!

20:07.340 --> 20:11.620
Huh, so even Chiba's women got some spunk.

20:11.620 --> 20:15.830
That guy came straight at me, unlike that blond fucker.

20:15.830 --> 20:17.990
They make a funny duo.

20:19.840 --> 20:19.880
BENIBANE SENIOR HIGH SCHOOL

20:27.390 --> 20:28.820
This is it.

20:28.820 --> 20:30.320
Masuda, this is his school!

20:30.320 --> 20:31.240
Good.

20:32.450 --> 20:34.330
He didn’t make it easy.

20:36.490 --> 20:37.840
Hey, kid!

20:39.150 --> 20:40.210
You mean me?

20:40.210 --> 20:43.920
You know a guy named Imai? Can you get him for us?

20:43.920 --> 20:44.900
Uh, sure.

20:55.300 --> 20:59.810
I’m Imai, the boss of Beni High. What the hell do you want?

20:59.810 --> 21:01.450
Oh, so you’re him.

21:01.450 --> 21:04.660
So that means the blond must be Mitsuhashi.

21:04.660 --> 21:06.520
Didn't know you were a fatass.

21:06.520 --> 21:09.490
You better lay off my weight before I send you home crying!

21:09.490 --> 21:11.030
What the fuck?!

21:16.260 --> 21:18.740
You got something to say, spit it out!

21:21.920 --> 21:24.710
You sure got a swagger on you, Imai.

21:24.710 --> 21:28.960
You know full well why we called you out here, right?

21:28.960 --> 21:31.920
What the fuck are you talking about? Spill it!

21:31.920 --> 21:34.050
Playing dumb, are we?

21:39.700 --> 21:43.140
Nice body you got. Too bad none of the blood goes to your brain.

21:43.140 --> 21:44.350
What didja say?

21:44.710 --> 21:45.980
Look at these cuts.

21:45.980 --> 21:47.770
You did this to me.

21:47.770 --> 21:49.570
The fuck you talking about?

21:49.570 --> 21:52.220
It’s your fault I got this blowback.

21:52.220 --> 21:55.160
Yeah, too bad for you.

21:55.160 --> 21:59.620
Do you think we’re fucking
playing here, you little shit?!

22:00.370 --> 22:01.200
Fucker...

22:02.670 --> 22:05.050
Don’t make me send you home crying!

22:05.050 --> 22:07.000
Say that to my face, you dumb punk!

22:07.000 --> 22:08.600
Get up, you fat fuck!

22:08.600 --> 22:10.340
Come on, look at us and fight!

22:10.340 --> 22:10.960
Koyama!

22:10.960 --> 22:13.670
What are you doing to Koyama?!

22:13.670 --> 22:14.840
Koyama?

22:14.840 --> 22:16.400
You're not Imai?

22:16.400 --> 22:17.960
Is this a joke?!

22:18.890 --> 22:22.470
What? The name Koyama shook your ass?

22:22.470 --> 22:24.060
You talking to me, kid?!

22:25.370 --> 22:29.690
That’s it... you little shitbirds have officially pissed me off!

22:30.560 --> 22:32.320
You think you can fuck with us?!

22:32.320 --> 22:33.940
No, stop!

22:33.940 --> 22:35.100
Hey!

22:35.100 --> 22:36.950
Fucking...

22:44.870 --> 22:48.280
Not only are Mitsuhashi and Imai in trouble with the yakuza,

22:48.280 --> 22:51.040
Nakano's also shown up to complicate things.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.430
Itou?

22:52.430 --> 22:54.520
Itou!

22:54.520 --> 22:55.320
Oh, what?

22:55.320 --> 22:58.650
So should we go with an umbrella or the hearts?

22:58.650 --> 22:59.820
I want you to decide.

22:59.820 --> 23:01.690
Uh, I’m fine with either.

23:01.690 --> 23:02.580
God...

23:02.580 --> 23:04.720
Do you even <i>want to get photo stickers?</i>

23:04.720 --> 23:06.080
Of course I do!

23:06.080 --> 23:09.350
I for one hate wishy-washy guys!

23:09.350 --> 23:10.450
Mitsuhashi?

23:10.450 --> 23:11.830
Itou...

23:11.830 --> 23:12.540
Where are you?

23:12.540 --> 23:13.480
Itou!

23:13.480 --> 23:15.270
M-Mitsuhashi!

23:15.270 --> 23:16.630
Where are you—

23:19.870 --> 23:22.530
Why the fuck would I be in <i>there,</i> dipshit?!

23:22.880 --> 23:25.610
Well I wouldn’t put it past you!

23:25.610 --> 23:28.440
Mitsuhashi, what are you doing up there?

23:28.440 --> 23:30.250
Oh, I got my reasons.

23:32.390 --> 23:35.630
Trees are the best places to hide from thugs and perverts.

23:35.630 --> 23:37.420
What are you, a monkey?

23:37.420 --> 23:42.850
Anyway, isn’t this "pervert" you’re talking about that Nakano guy we met in Kyoto?

23:42.850 --> 23:44.180
Huh, Nakano?

23:44.180 --> 23:47.780
Come on, the guy we fought during our class trip to Kyoto!

23:47.780 --> 23:48.860
From Ibaraki!

23:48.860 --> 23:51.940
He came after us earlier.
He says he wants revenge.

23:51.940 --> 23:54.750
Kyoto? Did something happen down there?

23:54.750 --> 23:58.020
You sure you’re not suffering from Alzheimer’s?

23:58.020 --> 24:00.780
So, Nakano from Ibaraki...

24:00.780 --> 24:04.030
The blond one’s name is Mitsuhashi.

24:04.030 --> 24:07.130
If we don’t find him quick, Masuda’ll yell at us!

24:07.130 --> 24:08.100
Hey,

24:08.100 --> 24:10.290
they’re talking about you, Mitsuhashi.

24:10.290 --> 24:11.450
What?

24:11.450 --> 24:13.500
Huh? Mitsuhashi?

24:13.860 --> 24:16.720
That kid will be easy to make with his blonde hair.

24:18.560 --> 24:20.710
You’re too heavy, Mitsuhashi!

24:20.710 --> 24:22.710
Itou! Can you dye your hair blonde?

24:22.710 --> 24:23.380
Hell no!

24:23.380 --> 24:25.230
Help a brother out, Mitsuhashi!

24:25.230 --> 24:26.850
<i>You’re Mitsuhashi, dammit!</i>

24:31.270 --> 24:35.700
Hissss, hiss-hiss-hiss-hiss...

24:41.160 --> 24:44.550
Let him go. We don’t want him to die on us.

24:44.550 --> 24:45.410
Right.

24:45.410 --> 24:46.120
Let’s move.

24:46.120 --> 24:46.860
Sure.

24:47.650 --> 24:49.890
Masuda, what’ll we do about the real Imai?

24:49.890 --> 24:51.320
Keep looking!

24:51.320 --> 24:53.670
We can’t go back empty-handed, stupid!

24:54.030 --> 24:55.660
We’re leaving no stones unturned!

24:55.660 --> 24:56.800
Got it!

25:06.280 --> 25:07.400
Koyama!

25:07.400 --> 25:09.180
Hey, hang in there, buddy!

25:09.180 --> 25:10.320
Imai...

25:10.320 --> 25:12.370
You all right? Hang on, Koyama!

25:12.370 --> 25:14.210
F-Forgive me...

25:14.210 --> 25:19.490
I tried to act in your place, but they took me out in no time flat.

25:19.490 --> 25:21.640
No, it’s okay.

25:21.640 --> 25:22.700
Don’t worry about it, Koyama.

25:22.700 --> 25:23.520
I’m sorry.

25:23.520 --> 25:25.700
I-Imai...

25:25.700 --> 25:27.830
It’s too dangerous for you to stick around.

25:27.830 --> 25:30.510
You need to g-get out of here...

25:31.660 --> 25:35.290
T... Tanigawa? Koyama...

25:35.760 --> 25:38.630
This... I...

25:40.340 --> 25:42.130
What have I become?!

25:44.470 --> 25:46.190
Take care of your wounds!

25:46.190 --> 25:48.810
I’ll take revenge for what they did to you!

25:57.470 --> 25:59.100
They’re gone!

26:03.760 --> 26:07.590
Christ, lay low at home if you’re this scared!

26:07.590 --> 26:09.600
Why be so harsh, Mitsuhashi?!

26:09.600 --> 26:11.290
The fuck you calling "Mitsuhashi"?!

26:11.290 --> 26:13.450
Will you shape up for once in your...

26:13.450 --> 26:16.040
Hey, isn’t that Imai?

26:16.040 --> 26:17.110
You’re right.

26:17.110 --> 26:20.250
He’s taking on those thugs we just spotted.

26:20.250 --> 26:22.470
I got nothing to say to you pipsqueaks.

26:22.470 --> 26:24.220
The fuck you call us?

26:24.220 --> 26:26.250
Don’t pick a fight with them!

26:26.250 --> 26:30.180
That moron! <i>I’m trying to hide, yet he’s directly challenging them?</i>

26:33.020 --> 26:33.770
Bastard!

26:33.770 --> 26:35.950
Get off my ass!

26:37.040 --> 26:40.520
I got nothing to say to you worthless cunts!

26:40.520 --> 26:42.570
I wanna see your fucking boss right now!

26:42.570 --> 26:45.110
Tell him Imai of Beni High’s got business with him!

26:50.400 --> 26:50.440
KATSUTOSHI

27:28.280 --> 27:29.960
What the hell set him off?

27:29.960 --> 27:31.910
This ain’t normal.

27:31.910 --> 27:33.670
The dude’s never normal.

27:33.670 --> 27:35.810
'Sides, when did he change clothes?

27:35.810 --> 27:39.620
When did <i>you change into <i>that getup?</i></i>

27:39.620 --> 27:44.530
Seriously, wasn’t there anything more nondescript and easier on the eyes?

27:44.530 --> 27:45.880
So it <i>is too loud?</i>

27:46.220 --> 27:48.860
But look at his eyes, he’s definitely all in.

27:48.860 --> 27:51.220
You don’t want to get on his bad side today.

27:51.850 --> 27:55.600
But he’s calling out the yakuza, which makes him a fucking idiot.

27:55.600 --> 27:59.400
I think he’s more of a man than someone who keeps running away hiding.

27:59.400 --> 28:00.560
Fine, you win.

28:18.770 --> 28:21.100
Shit, they really came!

28:22.210 --> 28:23.290
Itou?

28:23.290 --> 28:24.120
What?

28:24.120 --> 28:25.850
I’m heading home. It’s too dangerous here.

28:25.850 --> 28:27.180
B-But what about Imai?

28:27.180 --> 28:28.160
Screw him.

28:28.160 --> 28:29.680
Are you Imai?

28:30.650 --> 28:34.390
What’s that you got on? You in a fucking school play or something?!

28:34.390 --> 28:36.140
What do you think, Sudou?

28:36.140 --> 28:38.330
Yeah, that’s him all right.

28:38.330 --> 28:40.830
That's the dumbfuck who don't know his place.

28:40.830 --> 28:43.160
I can’t believe you actually invited us here.

28:43.160 --> 28:45.360
You got some balls, kid.

28:45.360 --> 28:46.300
Shaddap!

28:52.440 --> 28:55.270
This is for what you did to those kids, bastard!

29:00.290 --> 29:01.330
You little—

29:10.410 --> 29:11.210
He’s tough!

29:11.210 --> 29:13.430
He’s really taking them on!

29:13.430 --> 29:15.390
Why can’t you take down that kid?!

29:15.390 --> 29:19.160
Masuda, fuck the fun and games. Put him down for good.

29:19.160 --> 29:20.160
You got it.

29:34.450 --> 29:37.120
I’m really getting sick of your shit!

29:42.450 --> 29:44.190
That hurt.

29:44.190 --> 29:48.750
What'll you do if you put a scar on my handsome face, huh?

29:48.750 --> 29:52.970
Then I’ll make it so that you’re covered in bandages like me, Imai.

29:53.770 --> 29:57.550
Hell, I’ll even split your head open like a watermelon!

29:58.190 --> 30:01.370
You got time to spew bullshit, then do your thing, shithead!

30:01.370 --> 30:04.900
If you don’t move it, you’ll be needing new bandages!

30:05.240 --> 30:07.020
You... little punk!

30:07.790 --> 30:08.480
C’mon!

30:12.320 --> 30:13.110
No way!

30:16.070 --> 30:18.380
Should I flatten you like a pancake?

30:18.380 --> 30:20.540
There ain’t no bandage for that!

30:20.540 --> 30:22.720
No, stop it, you big goon!

30:22.720 --> 30:24.500
Wow, this is getting unreal.

30:37.130 --> 30:40.600
That’s Imai, the human punch line.

30:41.470 --> 30:43.820
What’s with him?

30:43.820 --> 30:45.210
Christ.

30:45.210 --> 30:48.060
Oww... he’s fucking crazy!

30:48.060 --> 30:49.390
God...

30:50.520 --> 30:52.770
You’re nothing but trouble!

30:55.120 --> 30:58.190
Aww, there’s the old Imai.

30:58.190 --> 30:59.410
All right, let’s go.

30:59.410 --> 31:02.210
Those dirty, lowlife scumbags!

31:02.210 --> 31:04.790
Where’re you going, Itou? Let’s jet!

31:04.790 --> 31:09.250
You don’t have to come!
I’m going down there myself!

31:09.840 --> 31:13.710
Yo, I’m leaving! The rain’s not letting up anyway.

31:19.850 --> 31:21.140
Who the fuck are you?!

31:25.620 --> 31:29.310
The guy’s already down! That’s against the rules!

31:29.310 --> 31:30.620
Dumb shit!

31:30.620 --> 31:33.530
You think there’re any rules to fighting?

31:33.530 --> 31:35.990
Oh? Is that right?!

31:52.220 --> 31:53.210
You shitbag!

31:57.520 --> 31:58.300
What?!

31:58.300 --> 31:59.500
Where’d he...

32:00.260 --> 32:01.720
Eyes on me!

32:06.020 --> 32:07.740
M-Masuda!

32:07.740 --> 32:09.830
Quit standing around, get him!

32:09.830 --> 32:10.880
Right!

32:13.570 --> 32:14.440
Somebody help!

32:15.190 --> 32:15.650
What the?

32:16.230 --> 32:18.110
I can’t stop this!

32:26.220 --> 32:27.250
You little shit!

32:27.810 --> 32:29.320
You coulda killed us, dumbass!

32:29.320 --> 32:31.330
Then I’da called a priest!

32:36.000 --> 32:36.760
Where is that...

32:42.090 --> 32:44.970
I’m all wet, so let’s go home!

32:45.360 --> 32:46.720
What’s this, Mitsuhashi?

32:47.140 --> 32:48.810
So you didn’t leave after all?

32:48.810 --> 32:53.160
I gotta make my presence known since I didn’t get a lotta action scenes.

32:58.850 --> 33:00.780
So we got one more, eh?

33:00.780 --> 33:02.030
Hell yeah!

33:02.030 --> 33:04.660
Mitsuhashi Special Kick!

33:20.430 --> 33:24.550
That was brilliant, magnificent! I couldn’t have asked for more.

33:24.550 --> 33:29.220
You got me so fucking hot, I <i>really</i> wanted to get in on the action.

33:29.220 --> 33:30.930
Ah! It’s you!

33:30.930 --> 33:33.660
I’m really liking you guys.

33:33.660 --> 33:37.150
Now I’m definitely glad I came to Chiba.

33:37.150 --> 33:41.860
What the fuck are you pulling? Shut up before I send you crying to momma!

33:41.860 --> 33:47.340
Ooh, I’m loving that look you got on! You got my adrenaline boiling!

33:48.280 --> 33:51.790
He really <i>is a pervert! Perverts are icky!</i>

33:52.420 --> 33:53.590
Wait up, Mitsuhashi!

33:53.590 --> 33:54.750
Y-You bastards!

33:55.330 --> 33:56.460
Get back here!

33:56.460 --> 33:57.350
Hey!

33:57.350 --> 33:58.990
Help me carry him!

33:58.990 --> 34:00.180
Perverts are icky!

34:00.180 --> 34:02.180
Mitsuhashi, don't leave me behind!

34:02.180 --> 34:06.110
You better hurry the fuck up and remember me.

34:08.460 --> 34:08.500
NAKANO, THE

34:08.460 --> 34:08.500
HAYSEED FROM IBARAKI,
DID THIS TO YOU!

34:10.000 --> 34:11.580
When did he...?

34:14.390 --> 34:15.960
This is perfect.

34:15.960 --> 34:17.640
I love this town.

34:17.640 --> 34:21.760
I’ll love it even more once I get those two lying at my feet.

34:29.780 --> 34:30.980
Imai.

34:30.980 --> 34:34.700
I’m so moved. You were totally awesome...

34:34.700 --> 34:36.750
Till you did yourself in!

34:36.750 --> 34:41.120
Tanigawa, can you be a little more gentle? I’m starting to get numb...

34:41.120 --> 34:42.480
Yow!

34:42.480 --> 34:43.770
I can’t take this.

34:52.800 --> 34:54.910
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

34:54.910 --> 34:57.350
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

35:00.910 --> 35:02.950
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

35:02.950 --> 35:05.150
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

35:08.910 --> 35:10.930
You and me are friends, partner.

35:10.930 --> 35:12.910
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

35:16.870 --> 35:18.950
I help you.

35:17.790 --> 35:18.950
We're family.

35:18.950 --> 35:20.880
I like you.

35:32.900 --> 35:34.870
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

35:34.870 --> 35:37.480
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

35:40.780 --> 35:42.320
That cute girl is mine,

35:42.320 --> 35:45.360
but I belong to no one.

35:48.850 --> 35:50.870
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

35:50.870 --> 35:52.860
When the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

36:54.750 --> 36:56.320
See you next time!
